{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ramen Shop</strong> is an psychological horror game where you manage a ramen shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders from your customers, serve them your delicious  ramen, and some drinks if they're thirsty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093970/extras/861d670e670924ea81a0d5266002472f.poster.avif?t=1763463804\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093970/extras/861d670e670924ea81a0d5266002472f.webm?t=1763463804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mika, recently hired to manage a ramen shop after the owner mysteriously fell ill. With every passing shift, the air grows colder and the incidents stranger. Can you uncover the truth before your fate is sealed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093970/extras/6386fa5934d99130bd2e19d0c18810a2.poster.avif?t=1763463804\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093970/extras/6386fa5934d99130bd2e19d0c18810a2.webm?t=1763463804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve customers your delicious ramens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do chores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the strange events</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093970?t=1763463804","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093970?t=1763463804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093970/86969e901ec925b5841630211a5eba3ae23dc218/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763463804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093970/86969e901ec925b5841630211a5eba3ae23dc218/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763463804","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4119170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ramen Shop</strong> is an psychological horror game where you manage a ramen shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders from your customers, serve them your delicious  ramen, and some drinks if they're thirsty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093970/extras/861d670e670924ea81a0d5266002472f.poster.avif?t=1763463804\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093970/extras/861d670e670924ea81a0d5266002472f.webm?t=1763463804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mika, recently hired to manage a ramen shop after the owner mysteriously fell ill. With every p